{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You live in a city where money and speed decide everything. There are no honest rules here, and the law is always one step behind. You are an illegal courier, trusted with what no one else can carry: people, packages, secrets. Every delivery is a race against time, the police, and the city itself \u2014 a city that never forgives mistakes.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082340/extras/4c28eae352363cf76a466db708d631f1.poster.avif?t=1760088780\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082340/extras/4c28eae352363cf76a466db708d631f1.webm?t=1760088780\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082340/extras/4c28eae352363cf76a466db708d631f1.mp4?t=1760088780\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Starting with a cheap wreck, you slowly break into the dangerous world of underground jobs. The faster and bolder you work, the higher the rewards \u2014 and the more serious the clients. But with every success, the police pressure grows: from simple patrol cars to full-scale roadblocks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Every ride is a challenge:</strong></i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<strong>jammed highways.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0blocked intersections.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0tight alleys and dark tunnels.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0sudden police traps that turn the city into a giant cage.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only those who risk everything have a chance to escape.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082340/extras/4fcc09579aa7fac55cda675b69d24c96.poster.avif?t=1760088780\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082340/extras/4fcc09579aa7fac55cda675b69d24c96.webm?t=1760088780\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0<strong>Illegal deliveries</strong> \u2014 transport people and goods that must stay in the shadows.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0<strong>Chases and ambushes</strong> \u2014 the police adapt to your driving style and never let go easily.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0<strong>A living metropolis</strong> \u2014 a dynamic city with traffic, random events, and countless alternate routes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0<strong>Deep customization</strong> \u2014 upgrade engines, suspension and brakes, change wheels, paint jobs, and create a car everyone will recognize.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0<strong>Risk and reward</strong> \u2014 the more dangerous the job, the bigger the payout. But is it worth it?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0<strong>Career progression</strong> \u2014 from a rookie with a junk car to a street legend whispered about in the underground. Every delivery tells a story. Sometimes it\u2019s a chance to make a fortune. Sometimes it\u2019s a trap. You never know who sits in the back seat, what lies in the trunk, and what awaits you around the next corner.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082340/extras/7f780f4a1a48ebced6c844929d88f8e6.poster.avif?t=1760088780\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082340/extras/7f780f4a1a48ebced6c844929d88f8e6.webm?t=1760088780\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082340/extras/7f780f4a1a48ebced6c844929d88f8e6.mp4?t=1760088780\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you turn the city into your own racetrack and become the ultimate courier \u2014 or will one mistake end your career forever?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4082340?t=1760088780","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4082340?t=1760088780","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082340/e510eb2109e7d93621c5c0a814a3d3fe1a864fa9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760088780","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082340/e510eb2109e7d93621c5c0a814a3d3fe1a864fa9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760088780","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Escape from the cops which are attacking you"},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You live in a city where money and speed decide everything. There are no honest rules here, and the law is always one step behind. You are an illegal courier, trusted with what no one else can carry: people, packages, secrets. Every delivery is a race against time, the police, and the city itself \u2014 a city that never forgives mistakes.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082340/extras/4c28eae352363cf76a466db708d631f1.poster.avif?t=1760088780\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082340/extras/4c28eae352363cf76a466db708d631f1.webm?t=1760088780\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082340/extras/4c28eae352363cf76a466db708d631f1.mp4?t=1760088780\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Starting with a cheap wreck, you slowly break into the dangerous world of underground jobs. The faster and bolder you work, the higher the rewards \u2014 and the more serious the clients. But with every success, the police pressure grows: from simple patrol cars to full-scale roadblocks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Every ride is a challenge:</strong></i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<strong>jammed highways.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0blocked intersections.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0tight alleys and dark tunnels.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0sudden police traps that turn the city into a giant cage.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only those who risk everything have a chance to escape.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082340/extras/4fcc09579aa7fac55cda675b69d24c96.poster.avif?t=1760088780\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082340/extras/4fcc09579aa7fac55cda675b69d24c96.webm?t=1760088780\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0<strong>Illegal deliveries</strong> \u2014 transport people and goods that must stay in the shadows.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0<strong>Chases and ambushes</strong> \u2014 the police adapt to your driving style and never let go easily.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0<strong>A living metropolis</strong> \u2014 a dynamic city with traffic, random events, and countless alternate routes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0<strong>Deep customization</strong> \u2014 upgrade engines, suspension and brakes, change wheels, paint jobs, and create a car everyone will recognize.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0<strong>Risk and reward</strong> \u2014 the more dangerous the job, the bigger the payout. But is it worth it?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0<strong>Career progression</strong> \u2014 from a rookie with a junk car to a street legend whispered about in the underground. Every delivery tells a story. Sometimes it\u2019s a chance to make a fortune. Sometimes it\u2019s a trap. You never know who sits in the back seat, what lies in the trunk, and what awaits you around the next corner.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082340/extras/7f780f4a1a48ebced6c844929d88f8e6.poster.avif?t=1760088780\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082340/extras/7f780f4a1a48ebced6c844929d88f8e6.webm?t=1760088780\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082340/extras/7f780f4a1a48ebced6c844929d88f8e6.mp4?t=1760088780\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you turn the city into your own racetrack and become the ultimate courier \u2014 or will one mistake end your career forever?</p>","developers":["CGI LAB GAMES SRL"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3967240","name":"Pursuit"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Racing","id":"9"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/